      "gabarito": {
        "valor": 42.0,
        "tolerancia": 0.042
      },
      "solucao": "- Sejam `A = 7k` e `B = 5k`.\n- `(7k + 6)/(5k + 6) = 4/3`\n- `3(7k + 6) = 4(5k + 6)`\n- `21k + 18 = 20k + 24`\n- `k = 6`\n- `A = 7 × 6 = 42`"
